      "message": "fix(2d): close Zigzag levels of avoid and 3D pockets with boundary rings\n\nThe 2D pocket with \"Do not touch\" and the 3D pocket levels cut Zigzag\nand Auto rows only. A row touches a wall or an island only at its end,\nso a cusp stayed between each two row ends over the full depth.\n\nBoth plans now take pocket_zigzag::rest_passes, as the plain 2D pocket\ndoes after #3021: rows 0.01 mm inside, then one closing ring on each\nboundary loop of the level's cutter-center area.\n\nPinned by crates/motion/tests/pocket_wall_finish_levels.rs.\n\nFixes #3129\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
