      },
      "message": "fix(3d): keep the rotary wrap's Zigzag rows; record #3129 decisions\n\nThe rotary wrap reads the same level plan with a seam. Its developed\narea ends at the seam, so a closing ring would cut one seam line twice.\nThe wrap keeps its rows; a follow-up issue tracks rings that skip the\nseam edges.\n\nThe Multi-Axis Rough test counted posed moves (<= 20). The closing ring\nround the boss poses each of its chords. The test now checks that each\npose stays within the ball's reach of the boss.\n\nRefs #3129\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
